
### Cadastro válido de hospital
POST http://localhost:8080/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Hospital Central",
  "city": "Recife",
  "latitude": -8.05,
  "longitude": -34.88,
  "priority": 1
}

### Cadastro inválido de hospital - latitude fora do limite
POST http://localhost:8080/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Hospital Teste Invalido",
  "city": "Recife",
  "latitude": 105,
  "longitude": -34.88,
  "priority": 1
}
